      "auditBasis": "The source places Fall of the Hulks: MODOK #1, which it calls a digital-only release, third in the Fall of the Hulks order. The vendored series index has no Fall of the Hulks: MODOK series; its only M.O.D.O.K. titles are M.O.D.O.K.: Reign Delay and Modok's 11. The provider search for Fall of the Hulks returned 9 issues (Alpha, Gamma, Red Hulk 1 to 4 and Savage She-Hulks 1 to 3) without the MODOK one-shot, MODOK returned only the 6 Modok's 11 issues, and Fall of the Hulks MODOK and MODOK 2010 returned 0. Searches with periods in M.O.D.O.K. returned HTTP 500 and are not counted as evidence. This bounds only these queries, not publication, provider-wide metadata or subscription availability, and no Marvel issue id is inferred. An unconfirmed search-index candidate, 32756, returned HTTP 404 from the provider detail endpoint on 2026-11-07 UTC; it is not adopted as the comic identity.",
